# Agent knowledge base

The living vault is under `docs/`. Follow `AGENTS.md` as the primary repository guide.

- **On-Demand Consultation Only**: Do NOT perform pre-flight reading loops (do not read `playbook.md`, `definition-of-done.md`, or app maps by default). For targeted tasks, proceed directly to the relevant code or config files.
- **Hard Limits**: No PR operations (opening/merging/approving). No fake tests. No secrets. Stop all dev servers and background processes before finishing.
- **No Routine Reviews / Git Checks**: Pre-Review QA audits are reserved strictly for the end of major changes or explicit user requests. Do not run git checks (`git status`, `git diff`) by default.
- **No Output Boilerplate**: Answer concisely without generating unrequested markdown review tables or checklists.
